    One row of the face histogram. The bar and the fair line behind it are told
    apart by colour alone, and the fair share is written nowhere on the row.
    %1$d is the face, %2$d how many times it came up, %3$s its share and %4$s
    what a fair die would give.
  -->
  <plurals name="stats_bar_against_fair">
    <item quantity="one">Face %1$d came up %2$d time, %3$s; a fair die, %4$s</item>
    <item quantity="other">Face %1$d came up %2$d times, %3$s; a fair die, %4$s</item>
  </plurals>
